WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:32.310
<b>Episode Five
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:32.310
Episode 5

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:36.320
Is...

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.380
Is that you?

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:53.890
Why?

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:57.310
Miaowu.

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:58.640
Dora!

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:00.310
Got it!

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:18.300
What's going on?

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:22.270
Where...

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:23.930
Where am I?

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:27.520
Ah Jie.

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:39.700
Ah Jie.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:42.780
Mother.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.670
Ah Jie, what's with you?

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:13.660
Wake up... Wake up!

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:17.210
Ah Jie.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.200
Your boss is here too, isn't he?

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.920
If you don't want to die, 
have him show himself.

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.170
Grandpa is winning.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.340
We gotta stop holding him back!

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.290
By the name of the Black Rose...

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:14.310
A little tip, darling.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:16.340
You should watch your back.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:46.220
Now let's descend into darkness together.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:56.310
Missy!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.930
Heal her!

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:09.180
Thank goodness. Her bleeding's stopped.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.770
Ice! Freeze!

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:29.750
Slash!

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:45.930
Die!

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:54.180
Master!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.180
Hana.

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:27.400
Harlan.

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:15.600
I've waited for this day for so long.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:20.970
Harlan.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.320
Goodbye.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:42.350
Objective complete.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.330
There's still a few alive.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.630
Leave them for now. They'll be useful.

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:33.310
Breaking news.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:36.840
The Black Rose Castle in the city 
outskirts was destroyed overnight.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:40.770
Police have sealed the area 
off for investigation.

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:43.140
Currently, no casualties have been found.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:48.350
According to reports, the castle belonged 
to the famous local entrepreneur Harlan.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:51.350
However, both Harlan and his 
family are currently missing.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.990
Stay tuned for the latest developments.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:01.220
I'm so pissed!

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:04.520
Last night, those guys 
chased our asses so hard,

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:06.100
I was scared shitless!

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:08.980
It's over! We don't even 
know who the enemies are!

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:13.350
How could you guys just sit there?!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.550
Even the Master's dead.

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:19.890
It's tough enough just to stay alive.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.640
I want revenge!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.440
Is it possible, though?

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:31.320
I've been looking for my brother for 
so long, and now he's the enemy.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.150
Ah Jie.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:36.850
We know nothing about the Destroyers.

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:38.740
The difference in power is night and day.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:42.220
Even if we run into them, 
we won't stand a chance.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:46.340
Let's calm down and figure out how 
to gather the information we need.

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.270
Ah Jie.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:53.300
How could you play on your 
phone at a time like this?!

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:54.280
Calm down.

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:56.730
I found us a lead.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.680
I found a video on the Internet.

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:04.390
It's the battle last night.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:13.680
Apparently someone streamed the entire 
battle last night using satellite cameras.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.460
I checked the uploader's account, too.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:18.770
It's full of news entries 
and articles on Summoners.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:23.590
They even have a comic 
called <i>The Moe Summoner</i>.

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:27.520
The art is crap, and the story's garbage,

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.130
but if you keep reading,

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:33.520
The Moe Summoner

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:33.520
you'll notice her portrayal of a Summoner's 
life is very detailed and accurate.

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:38.060
I suspect that we're dealing 
with a Summoner here.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:43.100
This observer up in the sky has 
to know much more than we do.

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:47.540
If we find her, she'll be the key to 
our comeback against the Destroyers.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:53.140
But how do we find her?

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:54.440
That's easy.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:57.140
The writer's holding a book signing event.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:58.970
Today, even.

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:01.220
Beautifully done.

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:05.240
Great Detective Ah Jie!

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:14.270
Greenball, we're leaving.

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:15.370
Take care of Hana.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.760
Don't die, you guys.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:21.810
Hana.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:25.560
You have a bad temper, and you're 
always making an enemy of us.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:27.850
But we promise you this.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:32.000
Those guys who hurt you will pay the price.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:49.220
Emergency announcement. 
Emergency announcement.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:54.020
Because of a circuitry fault, we will not 
be stopping at the Electric Town Station.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:59.270
Sorry, but I've got an errand to run.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:00.820
I have to get off here.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:06.680
Unlock.

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:08.000
Whoa!

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:12.010
The door swung open...

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:14.680
Emergency announcement. 
Emergency announcement.

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:18.160
The train is making an emergency stop 
because of an unknown breakdown.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:19.390
Please stay seated and wait.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:26.850
Coke.

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:34.850
Up.

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.060
It's going up?

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.320
What's going on?

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:57.830
This materialistic, 3D world is too boring.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.270
Let's switch it up!

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.070
What's with this weird music?

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.600
Mommy, what's that?

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:09.270
It's like nature is healing.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:24.020
Music, lights, stage.

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:25.220
Action!

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:28.140
<i>The Moe Summoner</i> book signing event

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:30.160
is starting right now!

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.770
Target sighted.

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:44.680
That's her.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:47.020
No idea if she's a friend 
or foe. I'll check her out.

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:48.740
You two flank her. Stay in cover.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:50.680
What a pain.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.170
She's just a little girl.

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:54.350
Can't we just knock her 
out and drag her back?

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:55.430
Don't drop your guard.

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:56.580
She could be very strong.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.960
If anything happens, we'll 
take her on together.

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:02.770
Let's start the hunt.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.040
No one came. This hurts.

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:28.020
I haven't even sold a single copy.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:31.250
So a Summoner story isn't gonna do it, huh?

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:36.300
Next time, I need to add 
some more explosions.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:42.350
This is amazing! What a masterpiece!

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:46.630
It's got an epic plot, epic 
fights, and epic fanservice!

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:51.350
I never expected to find an impassioned, 
well-crafted comic in this day and age!

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:52.860
What a kindhearted artist!

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.390
Fine eyes you got there!

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.930
It's a popular work, but I'll mark it 
down just for you! Buy one get ten free!

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:06.250
I'll take it all! For collection!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.140
Sold!

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:14.720
I hereby announce that today's book signing

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:17.520
is over!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.640
Since you're such a great customer,

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.980
I gotta show you some goodwill too.

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:26.810
Tell me.

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:29.930
What do you need from me today,

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:31.480
Ah Jie?

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:34.860
She figured it out...

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:37.740
How does she know my name?

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:39.600
Hey!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.270
The hottie over there, Dora.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.400
Do you want a copy, too?

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:48.940
Careful, Miaowu. Hiding in trees tend 
to lead to wardrobe malfunctions.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:52.960
Our plan is...

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:55.380
...a complete failure.

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.800
I noticed you guys right from the start.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.110
Not just today, even.

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:05.220
I've been keeping an eye on you guys.

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:08.700
Let's not beat around the bush, then.

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.020
Spill it.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:12.440
Who are you? What's your name?

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:13.740
Height? Weight? Three sizes?

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:15.030
Blood type? Zodiac? Horoscope?

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.430
Your job? Where do you live?

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.320
What's your social security number?

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:23.420
Ask something actually useful, you idiot.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:28.470
Well, it's a long story...

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.500
Stan, 1.4m, 75lbs,

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.930
60-60-60.

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:36.600
Blood type's AB, Rat, Sagittarius, student.

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:38.430
I live at 15 Qiushui Street.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:42.680
SSN's AKB48726.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:44.140
Mind telling us your ability?

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:47.270
My ability?

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:48.890
I'm great at mobile games!

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:50.740
What...?

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.060
What a loser...

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:57.260
Loser...?

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:02.460
Do you know what kind of videos Country U's 
president has in his D: drive's hidden folder?

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:06.910
Do you know whose birthday Country 
R's nuke launch codes are set to?

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.640
Do you know who leaked 
those Hollywood scandals?

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:15.930
Did you know Steve Jobs was a Summoner?

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:20.930
Did you know you were not ambushed 
by five Destroyers last night,

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.900
but seven?!

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:27.770
Don't underestimate me. In this digital age,

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.800
you can do just about anything 
just by lifting a finger.

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:35.100
I knew I found the right person.

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.140
Let me play with your phone!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:41.020
Whoa, that's a lot of cameras.

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:42.710
You peeping tom.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:48.310
Try this. You can control the 137 
civilian and 25 police cameras nearby.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.870
Tap this here, and you can 
switch to the satellite feed.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:53.010
There's both infrared and thermal.

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:54.520
Amazing!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:57.140
No wonder you found us right away.

00:18:58.020 --> 00:18:59.280
I got something better.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:01.230
Tap this. It emits a high 
frequency sonar pulse.

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:04.350
You can scan anything within 
300 meters, even a mosquito.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:07.690
If it detects any major 
threats, an alarm will go off!

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:13.310
Watch out!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:14.680
What's going on?

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:15.430
An explosion?

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:16.180
What's going on?

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:17.310
An explosion!

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:17.310
A terrorist attack?

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:19.220
Why is there an explosion?!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:19.970
What's going on?

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:21.070
It's dangerous here!

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:22.810
An enemy!

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:23.970
Where are they?!

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:27.770
Grade A alarm! Grade A alarm!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:29.840
Grade A alarm!

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:33.270
There are sixty ordinary folks around 
us, and four suspicious targets.

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.460
They are armed with unknown weapons, 
and they're coming toward us.

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:39.120
Target's approaching quickly!

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:40.520
200m.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:42.180
What should we do?

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:42.180
150m.

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:42.890
100m.

00:19:42.890 --> 00:19:44.600
50m.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:44.600
You had to ask?

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:48.310
Run for it!

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:53.350
Can't be less reliable, can you?

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:54.660
Why are you following me?!

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:56.680
They're after me!

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:58.350
You're important to us.

00:19:58.350 --> 00:19:59.720
We can't leave you be!

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:05.560
That was close!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.030
Who's hunting you down?

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:08.810
Beats me.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.810
Russian arms dealers, American 
CIA, Mexican cartels,

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:13.640
Italian mafia, African mercenaries...

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:14.930
Could be any of them.

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:19.340
You must be a real baddie 
to offend so many people.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:22.380
Can't help it. With great 
power comes great adversaries!

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.970
That's the fate that all superheroes face!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:33.820
What was that?!

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:34.560
Warning.

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:37.770
Warning! Target is approaching very quickly!

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:39.020
30m.

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:40.500
20m.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:43.270
10m.

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:45.180
What the hell?!

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.340
Guess I don't have a choice.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.600
No time to explain. Jump 
over the railing up ahead!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:58.340
What?

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:01.220
Jump!

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:39.340
<i>Sit with you watching the night sky</i>

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:44.580
<i>Vast stars reflect in our eyes</i>

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:52.170
<i>Like thousands of tiny wishes in our hearts</i>

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.690
<i>Longing to discover the origin of the 
mysterious everlasting ancient world</i>

00:21:57.690 --> 00:22:02.680
<i>The past and the present are 
linked in a fantastic instant</i>

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:07.680
<i>Watch over our beautiful 
home against evil forever</i>

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:12.670
<i>The blazing sun is our inevitable 
cruel test of growth</i>

00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:17.720
<i>May we return from thorny 
paths still being young</i>

00:22:17.720 --> 00:22:22.720
<i>With love and hate, laughter and 
tears, compose every touching moment</i>

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:27.680
<i>Five friends shoulder to shoulder, 
friendship will last until eternity</i>

00:22:27.680 --> 00:22:35.130
<i>With you tomorrow must 
be full of shining hopes</i>

00:22:35.130 --> 00:22:40.280
<i>Our tomorrow</i>
